/-!
# Proof Interface: LG21 Test-Optional Policies

This file is the implementation-facing theorem endpoint surface for
*Test-optional Policies: Overcoming Strategic Behavior and Informational Gaps*.
It contains source-facing wrappers, proof-seam endpoints, and support lemmas
used by the audit ledger.  The canonical human review file is
`PaperInterface.lean`; keep that file compact and DAG-shaped.
-/

namespace LG21TestOptionalPolicies

noncomputable section

